cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Settlement EVM reference in research, please cite the repository and exact Git commit."
title: "StateSync-GKR Settlement EVM"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Solidity reference for receipt-root authorization, route lifecycle control,
  and one-leaf transition consumption. Includes deterministic tests, fixed
  cross-language vectors, and bounded historical execution evidence.
  Unaudited and not ready for production; no Settlement release tag is claimed.
